; Directory Opus 5 is left where it is: it may be the user's own, and its installer chose the drawer.
Echo "Directory Opus 5 stays in place; delete its drawer (DOpus5:) by hand if you want it gone."
; the flat toolbar files this add-on put into DOpus5: go (Directory Opus itself stays)
Assign >NIL: DOpus5: EXISTS
If NOT WARN
  Delete >NIL: DOpus5:Images/Amarchy ALL QUIET FORCE
  Delete >NIL: DOpus5:Buttons/Amarchy-toolbar QUIET
  Delete >NIL: DOpus5:Buttons/Amarchy-toolbar-#? QUIET
EndIf
